# Naming

## Project name

- **Product name:** **Latch**
- **Package scope:** `@latch/*` (e.g. `@latch/dal`, `@latch/react`)
- **DB schema / table prefix:** `latch_*` (e.g. `latch_audit`)
- **Env prefix:** `LATCH_*` when needed

See [`docs/foundations/naming.md`](../../docs/foundations/naming.md). Former codename **Modula** is retired.

## Domain terms (locked)

| Term | Use | Don't say |
|---|---|---|
| **Surface** | A screen-shaped policy boundary (form/list) that spans tables | "Module" (deprecated) |
| **Field** | Logical permission unit, maps to 1+ columns | "Column" (raw DB term) |
| **Company** | Organizational customer with its own DB | "Tenant" (we don't do shared-schema) |
| **Manifest** | Server-resolved permission map for a scope | "Permissions object" (vague) |
| **PermissionContext** | Request-scoped: principal + manifest + active Surface | "Auth context" |
| **DAL** | Sole application path to business data | "Repository" / "ORM layer" |

## Code identifiers

| Kind | Convention | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Surface id | `snake_case` | `job_detail`, `customer_list` |
| Field id | `snake_case` | `financial_terms`, `salary_band` |
| Action | lowercase verb | `read`, `write`, `approve`, `delete`, `restore`, `hard_delete` |
| Role catalog id (`RoleId`) | UUID string | `latch_roles.id` (not `snake_case`; distinct from Surface/Field vocabulary) |
| Generated file | `*.generated.ts` under `generated/` | `job.schema.generated.ts` |
| Metadata file | `<surface>.surface.yaml`, `<surface>.policies.yaml` | `job.surface.yaml` |

> Old metadata files may still say `*.module.yaml` until the metadata renaming pass completes.
